%%label IV. Molto deliberato – Allegro risoluto – Maestoso
%%note D. A fanfare for brass and timpani; a quick movement on a theme made from the first movement’s fourths; and the first movement’s theme, broadly, to end.
X:1
T:Copland’s Missing Symphony
T:IV. Molto deliberato – Allegro risoluto – Maestoso
C:Claude (AI), in the manner of Aaron Copland
M:4/4
L:1/8
Q:"Molto deliberato" 1/4=54
%%score [fl ob cl bn] [hn tpt tbn] timp pno [v1 v2 va vc cb]
